{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "voltaras-payment-service-2026-0002",
    "name": "VOLTARAS Payment Service",
    "description": "API tests for the VOLTARAS Payment Service (prepaid wallet + Razorpay sandbox).\n\nSETUP\n1. Start Eureka, Auth, Bill, Organization, Payment Service and the API Gateway (http://localhost:8080).\n2. Register accounts via POST /api/auth/register (public route): a consumer (CONSUMER) and system-admin (ADMIN).\n3. Register an organization and join the consumer as an ACTIVE member; generate an unpaid bill for the consumer via the Bill Service (POST /api/bills/admin requires an ADMIN JWT).\n4. Export Razorpay sandbox credentials on the Payment Service: RAZORPAY_KEY_ID, RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET, RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET (rzp_test_... only).\n5. Open the Setup folder and run 'Login (Consumer)' and 'Login (System Admin)' first - the JWTs are stored automatically in accessToken / adminAccessToken.\n6. Run 'Get My Bills (Consumer)' to capture billId, then 'Get My Organizations' to capture organizationId.\n\nDo NOT add X-User-Id / X-User-Email / X-User-Role headers manually - the API Gateway validates the JWT and injects them automatically.\n\nFLOW\nRecharge (UPI/CARD) -> Razorpay sandbox checkout -> payment.captured webhook credits the wallet -> pay the bill from the wallet.\n\nFolders: Setup · Recharge & Wallet · Bill Payment & Idempotency · Inspect · Negative Tests\n\nThe Idempotency-Key header uses dynamic values ({{$guid}}) so the collection can be re-run safely. The Razorpay webhook requests need a valid HMAC-SHA256 signature over the raw body computed with RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET (generate it in the Razorpay dashboard or with a small script); no real card or financial data is used.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080" },
    { "key": "accessToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "adminAccessToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "organizationId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "billId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "paymentId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "paymentReference", "value": "" },
    { "key": "orderId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "rechargeReference", "value": "" },
    { "key": "idempotencyKey", "value": "" },
    { "key": "webhookSignature", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Setup",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (Consumer)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200 OK', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('JWT token is present', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.accessToken).to.not.be.undefined;",
                  "});",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', jsonData.accessToken);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"consumer-a@voltaras.com\",\n  \"password\": \"ReplaceWithYourPassword\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (System Admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200 OK', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('JWT with ADMIN role is present', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.accessToken).to.not.be.undefined;",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.role).to.eql('ADMIN');",
                  "});",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('adminAccessToken', jsonData.accessToken);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"system-admin@voltaras.com\",\n  \"password\": \"ReplaceWithYourPassword\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get My Bills (Consumer)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200 OK', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Captures an unpaid billId', function () {",
                  "    const unpaid = jsonData.find(function (b) { return b.paymentStatus === 'UNPAID' || b.paymentStatus === 'PARTIALLY_PAID'; });",
